Files under extensions/vendor/ are generated from dsh-vision-router source text by
tools/make-vendor.mjs. The prompt, pixel and OCR helpers there are copied
verbatim from src/lib/core-primitives.js; the sharp-backed helpers are
re-expressed against plain sharp because the Pi runtime has no DSH resource
governor, so only the budget wrapper is dropped. windows-desktop-capture.js is
copied verbatim. Every generated file carries the upstream copyright notice in
its header.

The port itself -- the Pi extension surface in extensions/index.ts,
extensions/engine.js and extensions/tools.js, the vendor generator, and the
tests -- was written for Pi and is distributed under the same MIT License.
